WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
First you'll want to keep a close eye on your inbox if you see a request for personal information

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.800
Don't rush to respond. It's likely a scam

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:13.200
You can always double check the sources legit with a phone call or just ignore it if you're unsure

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.400
But be careful some scams can be very professional
